OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after man 'threatens to
OL,4,Akill' Thames rower
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after allegedly
OL,7,Fmaking threats to kill on the River
OL,8,FThames after his boat hit a rower.
OL,10,FPolice said a white and blue boat was
OL,11,Freportedly being steered dangerously
OL,12,Fnear Maidenhead Rowing Club when the
OL,13,Fcollision happened at about 07:15 BST
OL,14,Fon Sunday.
OL,16,FThe suspect was also accused of
OL,17,Fverbally abusing a second rower who
OL,18,Frepeatedly tried to get away, police
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
